{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Pleasant RTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant plants, summon critters, earn upgrades &amp; battle your way across the lawn in this unique take on the real time strategy genre</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576870/extras/73e66f3afb074f326699a4cd02724e7c.avif?t=1762314644\" width=252 height=272 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576870/extras/79c10006b0039832a90fdbcb0d3164e7.avif?t=1762314644\" width=270 height=252 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >1v1 Me, Yo!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >eSports-grade online experience powered by a brand new <i>deterministic</i> multiplayer engine </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamless experience designed to deliver stable, low-latency games across multiple platforms <br><br><strong><i>Or you can always play offline verses AI!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576870/extras/d912da0321d8fe1b8fc948342a8245f2.avif?t=1762314644\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576870/extras_big/d912da0321d8fe1b8fc948342a8245f2.avif?t=1762314644 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VR Gardeners </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up and use your garden tools in a whole new way:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pour your watering can to heal friendly critters and flower</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whack enemy critters  with sticks and shovels </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heat things up with a flame thrower when the battle gets out of hand</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring fully-functional squirt-gun and slingshot for ranged attacks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576870/extras/8894f9c00f7f18979abd92915afeba95.avif?t=1762314644\" width=277 height=313 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576870/extras/26c9a91fa91cc5eb06d3fff81c5e8dc9.avif?t=1762314644\" width=268 height=258 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >However Your Garden Grows</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-&gt;Summon the elements to destroy the enemy beehive while defending your own</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-&gt;Practice new strategies offline verses a bot in the same fast-paced gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-&gt;Bees act as harvesters and bring you honey to spend on your garden</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-&gt;Unlock new tools in the tool shed, upgrade units to add new abilities</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576870/extras/cd55109fa09ccea44f6c57db760f434c.avif?t=1762314644\" width=668 height=883 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2576870?t=1762314644","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2576870?t=1762314644","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576870/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762314644","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576870/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762314644","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},